cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Agent Reliability Engineering Database (AREDB)"
abstract: >-
  A public taxonomy of catastrophic autonomous-agent failures, each with a
  stable ARE-YYYY-NNN identifier and an honest coverage flag. Cite the
  identifiers (e.g. ARE-2026-001) as the shared reference for the field.
message: >-
  If you use this database, please cite it and keep the ARE-YYYY-NNN
  identifiers intact. Attribution satisfies the CC-BY-4.0 license.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "AgentX-Core"
    website: "https://agentx-core.com"
url: "https://github.com/vdalal/ARE-Incident-Database"
repository: "https://github.com/vdalal/ARE-Incident-Database"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - agent-reliability-engineering
  - ARE
  - AI-agent-failures
  - agent-security
  - incident-taxonomy
